      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, when you say it's \"unworkable\" and \"less effective,\" it sounds like you're saying the sovereignty side is pretty much a dead end. if the data shows that global cooperation is the only way to actually solve these big issues, isn't it basically a fact that following international standards is the only logical path forward for any serious country?",
